{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25853","headline":"重别西湖 · 李绅","name":"重别西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浦边梅叶看凋落，波上双禽去寂寥。\n吹管曲传花易失，织文机学羽难飘。\n雪欺春早摧芳蕚，隼励秋深拂翠翘。\n繁艳彩毛无处所，尽成愁叹别谿桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}